        "PMC11032334::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC12964539::web::022::dislocation_activities_at_atomic_scale_a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced compositional complexity at interfaces increases local lattice distortion.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11032334::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC12964539::web::022::dislocation_activities_at_atomic_scale_a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Greater lattice distortion pins dislocations more effectively and delays collective slip.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11032334::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC12964539::web::022::dislocation_activities_at_atomic_scale_a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once accumulated dislocations exceed a threshold, localized shear banding initiates and governs the creep deformation rate.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting multilayers have relatively low interfacial short-range order and moderate lattice distortion.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Changing interfacial composition can tune interfacial short-range order and lattice distortion.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11032334::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced interfacial short-range order increases lattice distortion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced short-range order, through associated lattice distortion, initially retards plastic deformation by impeding dislocations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10873362::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC11032334::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under sustained loading, dislocations accumulate at FCC/BCC interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial dislocation accumulation promotes localized shear bands.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A transition from homogeneous dislocation activity to strain localization explains progressive creep.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced interfacial short-range order will prolong strain hardening.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10873362::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12964539::web::022::dislocation_activities_at_atomic_scale_a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced interfacial short-range order will increase creep resistance.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced interfacial short-range order will delay the onset of localized shear banding relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
